{"id":"FR1814168113","current":{"csp":"Authentic8, Inc.","cso":"Silo","status":"FedRAMP Certified","phase":"Ongoing Certification","cert_type":"Rev5","cert_path":"Agency","cert_class":"Class C","impact_level":"Unknown","independent_assessor":"Linford & Company","partnering_agency":null,"annual_assessment":null,"cert_date":"2021-03-29T04:00:00.000Z","under_cap":false,"service_model":["SaaS"],"deployment_model":"Public Cloud","business_categories":[],"fedramp_msg":"","ready_status":"Unknown","ip_jab_status":"Unknown","ip_pmo_status":"Unknown","ip_agency_status":"Unknown","ip_prog_status":"Unknown","small_business":false,"uei":null,"service_acronym":"Silo","website":"https://www.authentic8.com/","sales_email":null,"security_email":"fedramp@authentic8.com","trust_center":null,"secure_configuration_guidance":null,"certified_services":[],"third_party_information_resources":null,"independent_assessor_id":"140531","status_date":"2021-03-29T04:00:00.000Z","cap_date":null,"service_desc":"Silo is a remote browser that embeds security, identity and data policies directly into the browser. Available from anywhere, policies follow users regardless of environment. By shifting exposure away from the user's network and devices, Silo reduces risk and improves internal processes. With a configurable, centrally managed browser, users unlock the power of SaaS.\nAuthentic8 is redefining how enterprises conduct business on the web with the Silo web isolation platform. Silo insulates and isolates all web data and code execution from user endpoints, providing powerful, proactive security while giving users full, interactive access to the web. Silo also gives IT complete control over how the web is used. Commercial enterprises and public sector organizations use Silo solutions to provide secure web access; to control web data, apps, and workflows; and to conduct sensitive online research.","event_log":[{"date":"2020-11-12T05:00:00.000Z","category":"Status Change","description":"Status set to